<title>JAPAN: Yokohama Matsuzakaya -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Yokohama Matsuzakaya -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	     9.66		vs	   10.59</p>
<p> Operating   loss 463    million	  vs   loss 574    million</p>
<p> Current     loss 495    million	  vs   loss 600    million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 537    million	  vs   loss 530    million</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 26.89 yen	  vs    loss 26.53 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     20 million	  vs	  20 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Yokohama Matsuzakaya Ltd is a department store operator.</p>
</text>
